{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Business hours{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    <h1>Inside the window</h1>
    <p>
        You reached this page, so two things are true at once: it is between 9:00 and 18:00, and you
        hold <code>ROLE_MANAGER</code> (directly or through the hierarchy).
    </p>
    <p class="muted">
        Outside the window the handler refuses before it ever looks at the nested policy, so an
        administrator is turned away with the same message a stranger gets. The clock is injected
        into the handler rather than read from the access environment: an entry point fills the
        environment with what it alone knows, and a policy that abstained on a missing key would
        fail open.
    </p>
{% endblock %}
